{
    "title": "Daily Horoscope Launcher",
    "description": "Horoscope Launcher offers reliable daily horoscope readings for every zodiac sign, bringing clarity to your life journey. With one-swipe access from your home screen, uncover astrological insights for Aries, Taurus, Gemini, Cancer, Leo, Virgo, Libra, Scorpio, Sagittarius, Capricorn, Aquarius, and Pisces every day. Gain foresight into love, health, emotions, and career with our popular astrology and horoscope app!\r\n\r\nPlease note: As a launcher app, the layout of your home screen may change after install. Don\u2019t worry, all your apps are still on your phone - they just may be in a different location. To learn more, please visit our FAQ section: https://horoscopedaily.app/#faq\t\r\n\r\nWith a launcher app, you get the added benefits of: \r\n\ud83d\ude80 <b> One-swipe access </b>\r\nGet your personalized horoscope by simply swiping right from your home screen!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 <b> Home screen widget </b>\r\nSee the time, weather, and more, conveniently on your home screen with our customized widget.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <b> Wallpaper </b>\r\nPersonalize your home or lock screen  with a wide selection of beautiful horoscope themed wallpapers. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe0 <b> Home screen shortcut </b>\r\nUse the Daily Horoscope Launcher shortcut on your home screen to get fast access to horoscope readings and compatibility insights. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d <b> Multi-touchpoint search </b>\r\nApps and web search has never been easier. Search for installed apps or the web (powered by Yahoo) from multiple access points.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f <b> Daily Horoscope & Astrological Guidance </b>\r\nHoroscope Launcher provides daily insights across categories like love, career, health, and emotions. Track yesterday\u2019s, today\u2019s, and tomorrow\u2019s predictions for each zodiac sign and see how the stars align for your life\u2019s path. Share your astrological wisdom with friends and family!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b> New Feature! Relationship Compatibility </b>\r\nOur compatibility feature allows you to explore romantic zodiac compatibility. Simply enter your zodiac sign and your partner\u2019s to discover if your relationship is compatible. Understand the positive and negative aspects of your compatibility with zodiac-based astrology!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd2e <b> Key Features </b>\r\n- Compatibility by zodiac sign: Uncover how compatible you are with your partner based on zodiac compatibility, using insights rooted in astrology.\r\n- Daily horoscopes for all zodiac signs: Get horoscope readings tailored for Aries, Taurus, Gemini, Cancer, Leo, Virgo, Libra, Scorpio, Sagittarius, Capricorn, Aquarius, and Pisces.\r\n- Horoscope predictions by category: Explore specific categories like love horoscopes, career horoscopes, health horoscopes, and mood horoscopes to see what\u2019s ahead.\r\n\r\nGet the Daily Horoscope Launcher to access daily horoscopes, horoscope predictions by category, and compatibility insights from your home screen.\r\nPlease write to us should you have any queries or comments about the app, including recommendations for new features. Also, please note that you can uninstall it at any time.\r\n\r\nYou give your consent to install Horoscope Launcher from the Google Play\u2122 Store by clicking the button above. You also agree to this app's Terms and Conditions & Privacy Policy.\r\n\r\nGoogle Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.\r\n\r\nFor questions or feedback, reach out to us through our contact form: https://horoscopedaily.app/contact-us\r\n\r\nPP - https://horoscopedaily.app/atom/dailyhoroscope/terms/privacypolicy.html\r\nTOS - https://horoscopedaily.app/atom/dailyhoroscope/terms/tos.html",
